codex
The new rule appears to be: suppress escalation when maintenance is active and `users_affected ≤ 0.5`.

One example conflicts with this rule and the existing model: it has `users_affected = 0.697`, but its label is zero. I will document this conflict rather than add a condition that fits only that example.
